      "fallback_used": null
    },
    {
      "segment": "comment_2",
      "role": "COMMENT",
      "status": "OK",
      "style": "(existing 6-role value, unchanged)",
      "asr_text": "So far, the key point is that the 20% charge was announced without clear details. Now, what happened to the plan the next day, and when did the oil price rise occur?",
      "attempts": 1,
      "duration": 11.2,
      "mp3": "b1b_comment_2.mp3",
      "fallback_used": null
    },
    {
      "segment": "comment_3",
      "role": "COMMENT",
      "status": "OK",
      "style": "(existing 6-role value, unchanged)",
      "asr_text": "The 20% charge was announced, but important details were not clear. About a day later, the plan changed to trade and investment projects, while oil prices had already risen amid concern about a planned U.S. sea blockade of Iran and energy shipments through the Strait. Next, listen for how the timing of that oil move fits into the story.",
      "attempts": 2,
      "duration": 21.61,
      "mp3": "b1b_comment_3.mp3",
      "fallback_used": null
    },
    {
      "segment": "comment_4",
      "role": "COMMENT",
      "status": "OK",
      "style": "(existing 6-role value, unchanged)",
      "asr_text": "The story began with a proposed 20% charge, then changed quickly the next day, but oil prices did not simply return to where they started, so let's bring the main point together now.",
      "attempts": 1,
      "duration": 11.81,
      "mp3": "b1b_comment_4.mp3",
      "fallback_used": null
    },
    {
      "segment": "full_story_part1",
      "role": "FULL_STORY",
      "status": "OK",
      "style": "(existing 6-role value, unchanged)",
      "asr_text": "This news feels like a short play in three acts. Act 1 was 20%. Act 2 brought an unexpected turn. Act 3 was an unexpected move in oil prices. The curtain rose on July 13th. At 10:16 a.m., Trump posted that the United States would seek a 20% charge on all cargo passing through the Strait of Hormuz. The aim was to recover the cost of U.S. efforts to keep the strait safe. But 20% was not a finished system. The post did not say who would pay, how the money would be collected, or what legal basis would support it. For the moment, only a large number stood at center stage. The number stayed at center stage for about a day. Then the story took a sharp turn.",
      "attempts": 1,
      "duration": 44.39,
      "mp3": "b1b_full_story_part1.mp3",
      "fallback_used": null
    },
    {
      "segment": "full_story_part2",
      "role": "FULL_STORY",
      "status": "OK",
      "style": "(existing 6-role value, unchanged)",
      "asr_text": "About 24 hours and 48 minutes later, at 11:04 a.m. on July 14, Trump said the 20% plan would be replaced by trade and investment projects between Gulf states and the U.S. He cited very productive discussions with Middle Eastern leaders. He also said no one should charge ships in the Strait and that he disliked fees. The change was sudden, but to read the oil move, the dates must be kept separate. On July 13, Brent rose 9.59% and settled at $83.30. Reuters linked that rise to concern about a U.S. sea blockade of Iran planned for the next day and energy shipments through the Strait of Hormuz.",
      "attempts": 1,
      "duration": 43.72,
      "mp3": "b1b_full_story_part2.mp3",
      "fallback_used": null
    },
    {
      "segment": "full_story_part3",
      "role": "FULL_STORY",
      "status": "OK",
      "style": "(existing 6-role value, unchanged)",
      "asr_text": "On July 14th, after the withdrawal and replacement announcement, Brent crude futures briefly gave back some of their gains. Soon, they returned close to the high level before the announcement. At the time of reporting, Brent was up about 2.6%, above $85 a barrel. Its final settlement price was $84.73, up 1.7% from the day before.",
      "attempts": 1,
      "duration": 26.03,
      "mp3": "b1b_full_story_part3.mp3",
      "fallback_used": null
    },
    {
      "segment": "full_story_part2_heading",
      "role": "HEADING",
      "status": "OK",
      "style": "(existing 6-role value, unchanged)",
      "asr_text": "The 20% plan changes overnight.",
      "attempts": 1,
      "duration": null,
      "mp3": "b1b_full_story_part2_heading.mp3",
      "fallback_used": null
    },
    {
